# Demo source maps (recreate with: node demo/build.cjs)
# The bundles themselves stay tracked - docs/demo/ is what Forge serves at
# scarlettplayer.com, and release.yml commits a rebuild on every push to main.
# The maps are 3MB debug artifacts nothing serves, so tracking them only ever
# produced merge conflicts against that bot commit.
#
# Do NOT add the bundles here. On 2026-08-11 they were ignored to stop branch
# authors committing them, which also silenced release.yml's `git add demo/
# docs/demo/`: the rebuild step still stamped ?v=<version> onto index.html and
# committed that, so scarlettplayer.com shipped a script tag pointing at a
# bundle no longer in the repo, and the demo 404'd for every visitor. Branch
# hygiene is a review concern, see the Release / PR Checklist in CLAUDE.md.
demo/demo.bundle.js.map
docs/demo/demo.bundle.js.map
